        "speaker": "S1",
        "text": "My name is Omar and I am twelve years old. I go to school by bus. The bus comes at seven forty, and school starts at eight thirty. My first lesson on Monday is maths. I like maths because my teacher, Mr Brown, is funny. After maths, we have English and then science. At ten thirty we have a break for twenty minutes. I eat an apple and talk to my friends. Lunch is at twelve o'clock. There is pasta, chicken or a salad. I always have pasta. In the afternoon we have art and sport. Sport is my favourite lesson. We play basketball in the gym. School finishes at three forty. After school, I do my homework and then I play computer games for one hour. I go to bed at nine o'clock."
      }
